'''Events''' take place throughout SkyBlock. They can be accessed by opening the [[SkyBlock Menu]] and clicking [[File:Clock.png|21px]] [[Calendar|Calendar and Events]].

A [[Time System|SkyBlock Year]] is exactly {{Green|5}} days and {{Green|4 hours}}, meaning the timing of events rotates to suit different timezones.

== Yearly Events ==
{{See also|Shen's Auction}}
Multiple '''Events''' take place at the same in-game time every SkyBlock year. Some events are held in the [[Event Square]], while others are held elsewhere.

{{:Events/Yearly Events Table}}

=== Yearly Events System ===
These events appear in a {{green|12 year}} cycle. The year's shop can be located at the [[Hub Well]].

{{:Events/Yearly Events System Table}}

=== Calendar Events ===
These events only appear when looking directly into the calendar and are not shown in the Events menu, because they are far more common. Major events however appear in Calendar as well as the Events menu.

{{:Events/Calendar Events Table}}

=== Mayor Events ===
Those events occur only when a [[Mayor Election|Mayor]] or [[Mayor Election|Minister]] is elected with the corresponding perk.

{{:Events/Mayor Events Table}}

=== Annual Events ===
These events happen using the real-life [[w:Gregorian calendar|Gregorian calendar]].

{{:Events/Annual Events Table}}

