== Interface ==
The Event Rewards interface is for players to collect event rewards that were not yet collected, it can be accessed from the [[Calendar and Events]] menu.
{{/UI}}

==Trivia==  
*One SkyBlock year lasts 372 SkyBlock days, with each month lasting 31 days exactly.
*There are exactly 124 [[Dark Auction]]s and 124 [[Jacob's Farming Contest]]s in one SkyBlock year.

